  type_array_err_too_large_param.pcpp - break step of type_array.pcpp:
  where a parameter holds it by value, at its type (SM0277)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_too_large_param.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_array_err_too_large_param.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
